    "text": "Aubrey Plaza Pregnant With Greenwich Actor Chris Abbott: Report | Greenwich Daily Voice 67° Tuesday, apr 14 SHARE Aubrey Plaza is expecting her first baby, PEOPLE reports. Chris Abbott and Aubrey Plaza Photo Credit: Kevin Payravi/Xfranksun Cecilia Levine Email me Read More Stories 04/07/2026 10:50 p.m. The \"Parks and Recreation\" star, 41, and her partner Chris Abbott, 40, a Greenwich, CT native, are expecting their first child together this fall, the outlet reports.PEOPLE quoted a source saying that the baby was a \"beautiful surprise\" after an \"emotional year.\" Plaza lost her husband, Jeff Baena, last year.Abbott rose to fame in his role as Marnie's boyfriend Charlie, on HBO's \"Girls.\"Plaza and Abbott worked together on \"Danny and the Deep Blue Sea,\" an Off-Broadway revival, and the 2020 movie \"Black Bear.\" Abbott currently stars in Arthur Miller's \"Death of a Salesman\" Broadway revival. Click here for more from PEOPLE. Click here to follow Daily Voice Greenwich and receive free news updates. SCROLL TO NEXT ARTICLE Breaking News These Northeast Locales Will See Hottest Temps During Summer-Like Stretch Coming Up Next A Mom Designed The Shampoo Bottle We've All Needed — And Her Brand Is Going National Body Of Missing Woman Found In Long Island Sound, Police Confirm Streaks Of Light To Fill Skies During Weeks-Long Meteor Shower: Best Times To Watch Winners for Fairfield County Thai Basil Best Thai Dave & Buster's Milford Best Indoor Recreation Fin Japanese Restaurant Best Japanese The Maritime Aquarium at Norwalk Best Children's Activity Posh Nails & Spa Westport Best Nail Salon View 2025 Winners Get Daily Voice In Your Inbox Get important news about your town as it happens. Your Daily Voice Site (not your town?) Greenwich×Greenwich Get News In Your Inbox Daily Try again > Sign up for free Get Daily Voice in your inbox as well Something went wrong. Please subscribe again. I'll Do It Later News When You Need It Enable push notifications to get